{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#card-zh","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的网络代理插件，可将 agent 发起的全局 fetch 请求及 web_fetch 所用的 harness 请求转发到 HTTP 或 SOCKS5 代理。插件通过配置文件保存代理地址、认证、绕过列表、超时和 TLS ALPN 策略，并可选择跟随系统代理。设置页支持连通性探测、配置编辑、请求日志查看与清空，以及流量图表和单条内容详情。适合需要统一配置 DSH 网络出口并查看请求情况的使用者；不需要 API 密钥，需提供可连接的代理地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:119-150","lib/index.js:186-210","lib/config.js:12-27","lib/routes.js:53-105"]}
{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#card-en","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-net-proxy is a network proxy plugin for the DSH Web client. It routes the agent’s global fetch requests and harness requests used by web_fetch through an HTTP or SOCKS5 proxy. Its configuration stores the proxy address, optional authentication, bypass list, timeout, and TLS ALPN policy, with an option to follow system proxy settings. The settings page offers connectivity checks, configuration editing, request logs with clear and detail views, and traffic charts. It suits DSH users who need to configure network routing and inspect proxied requests; no API key is required, but a reachable proxy endpoint must be supplied.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:119-150","lib/index.js:186-210","lib/config.js:12-27","lib/routes.js:53-105"]}
