{"unit_id":"mafeis__dsh-net-proxy#feature-f1","repo":"mafeis/dsh-net-proxy","commit":"9ceae9edffe04bd1d80b0d39a052e964a1da6b67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-proxy 的功能「双通道请求代理」：插件启用时包装全局 fetch，并同步策略到 DSH harness 代理层，让两类 agent 网络请求都能按代理配置转发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:119-150"]}
